msgstr "Гэта настаўленне"

#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/preferences/config_model.cpp:1006
msgid "%1: choose a folder of this computer."
msgstr "%1: абярыце папку на гэтым камп'ютары."

#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/preferences/config_model.cpp:1035
msgid "Select a category to reset."
msgstr "Абярыце катэгорыю для скіду."

#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/preferences/config_model.cpp:1097
msgid "Repeat the current item (One) or the whole play queue (All)."
msgstr "Паўтараць бягучы элемент (Адзін) або ўсю чаргу прайгравання (Усе)."

#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/preferences/config_model.cpp:1105
#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/preferences/qml/SettingsPresentation.qml:120
msgid "When playback finishes"
msgstr "Калі прайграванне скончыцца"

#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/preferences/config_model.cpp:1106
msgid "Stop, or quit VLC at the end of the play queue."
msgstr "Спыніць або выйсці з VLC у канцы чаргі прайгравання."

#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/preferences/config_model.cpp:1114
#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/preferences/qml/SettingsPresentation.qml:47
msgid "Use a custom skin"
msgstr "Выкарыстоўваць уласную абалонку"

#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/preferences/config_model.cpp:1115
msgid "Starts VLC with the skin chosen below instead of this interface."
msgstr "Запускае VLC з абранай ніжэй абалонкай замест гэтага інтэрфейсу."

#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/preferences/config_model.cpp:1131
#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/preferences/qml/SettingsPresentation.qml:94
msgid "Remember the playback position"
msgstr "Запамінаць пазіцыю прайгравання"

#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/preferences/config_model.cpp:1132
msgid "Lets VLC continue the media where you left off."
msgstr "Дазваляе VLC працягваць медыя з месца, дзе вы спыніліся."

#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/preferences/config_model.cpp:1146
#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/preferences/qml/SettingsPresentation.qml:287
msgid "Reverse scroll direction"
msgstr "Адваротны кірунак пракруткі"

#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/preferences/config_model.cpp:1147
msgid "The wheels that seek go backwards when turned forwards."
msgstr "Колцы, што перамотваюць, перамотваюць назад, калі іх круціць наперад."

#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/preferences/config_model.cpp:1162
#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/preferences/qml/SettingsPresentation.qml:290
msgid "Web remote control"
msgstr "Вэб-кіраванне"

#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/preferences/config_model.cpp:1163
msgid ""
"Lets a web browser control VLC. Set its password in the Advanced Options."
msgstr ""
"Дазваляе кіраваць VLC з вэб-браўзера. Пароль задайце ў Пашыраных параметрах."

#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/preferences/config_model.cpp:1181
#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/preferences/qml/SettingsPresentation.qml:328
msgid "Video post-processing"
msgstr "Постапрацоўка відэа"

#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/preferences/config_model.cpp:1182
msgid ""
"Improves the picture of poorly encoded videos, at the cost of processing "
"power."
msgstr ""
"Паляпшае відарыс дрэнна закадаваных відэа за кошт вылічальнай магутнасці."

#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/preferences/config_model.cpp:1231
#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/preferences/qml/SettingsPresentation.qml:215
msgid "Visualization size"
msgstr "Памер візуалізацыі"

#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/preferences/config_model.cpp:1232
msgid "The size the visualizations are drawn at."
msgstr "Памер, у якім малююцца візуалізацыі."

#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/preferences/config_model.cpp:1233
msgid "Match window"
msgstr "Як акно"

#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/preferences/config_model.cpp:1274
#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/preferences/qml/SettingsPresentation.qml:121
msgid "Seek precisely"
msgstr "Дакладная перамотка"

#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/preferences/config_model.cpp:1275
msgid ""
"Seek to the exact time asked, slower than seeking to the nearest key frame."
msgstr ""
"Перамотка да дакладна зададзенага часу, павольней за перамотку да бліжэйшага "
"ключавога кадра."

#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/preferences/config_model.cpp:1371
